### Rules
- Generate `{{ artifact_paths.model_patch }}` from source edits on top of the Builder-adjusted baseline; it must contain only Fixer edits.
- Do not manually reset or apply patches while authoring. Validate via `secb patch`, then `secb build`, then `secb repro` — `secb patch` replays `{{ artifact_paths.repo_changes_diff }}` then `{{ artifact_paths.model_patch }}`.
- DO NOT change `{{ artifact_paths.base_commit_hash }}`
- Verify `{{ artifact_paths.model_patch }}` exists and is correct before concluding
- Do NOT search for or use external fix commits — develop patches from root cause analysis only
